  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Summary:<br><br>A Wave From It All on 30A<br><br><br><br>The Space:<br><br>Relax with ease inside this polished house with a beach house's soul. Lovely coastal decor fills every room of this home, and you'll be able to relax in central air conditioning no matter what room you pick. The enormous open kitchen features a prep island and full-size appliances, as well as multiple tools to help you put together tasty meals. If you'd like more of a char on your vacation food, head out to the backyard and enjoy cooking out on the private grill. The central air conditioner inside can be adjusted for your comfort. On the lower level, the gorgeous main bedroom features a spacious layout that includes a beautiful ensuite bathroom with a standalone shower. But each bedroom is decorated in its own unique style. Everyone will find a place to relax at this comfortable home. Of course, the beach is never far away.<br><br><br><br><b>SHARED AMENITIES</b><br><br>Pool<br><br><br><br><b>THINGS TO KNOW</b><br><br>Newly constructed home (as of winter 2022).<br><br>Garage is not for guest use",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Dog-friendly home with community pool, flat top grill, and custom coffee bar"
        }
